# ─── OCHI booking wiring ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Two layers:

# 1) CLIENT — where the browser POSTs the booking form. Point it at the
#    same-origin proxy below (no CORS, secret stays server-side). Leaving this
#    UNSET keeps submitBookingRequest() in local-stub mode (resolves success
#    without any network call).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SECRETARY_BOOKING_URL=/api/book

# 2) SERVER — the /api/book proxy forwards here with the shared secret.
#    UPSTREAM is Ernest's public lead-intake endpoint; SECRET must match
#    OCHI_BOOKING_SECRET in the ErnestOfGaia deploy. If either is unset the
#    proxy degrades to a soft success and the page's text/email fallbacks
#    remain the real path.
SECRETARY_BOOKING_URL=https://ernestofgaia.xyz/api/ochi-booking
OCHI_BOOKING_SECRET=
